 "description": "Sweep the source chain across independent endpoints for every in-scope event in a claim's range, take the union, and check each event against the claim on-chain. Needs no key and spends nothing. Reports complete with provenance, or the omitted event \u2014 which refute_claim can then prove, if the claim is still inside its window. Finalized and refuted claims can be swept too, for the record; open ones are still being built and cannot.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
